    {
      "subId": "7329504",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Julien",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "732950401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "732950401": {
            "id": "732950401",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Are you alright?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732950402"
            ]
          },
          "732950402": {
            "id": "732950402",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Julien",
            "text": "I—I... *sigh* Thank you both for saving me.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732950403"
            ]
          },
          "732950403": {
            "id": "732950403",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Julien",
            "text": "I had a wonderful dream last night. In my dream, Caterpillar was standing at the end of the pilgrim's path, waving at me, and in that dream... Well, it was strange. Why was the path just one cavern after another?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732950404"
            ]
          },
          "732950404": {
            "id": "732950404",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Julien",
            "text": "But Caterpillar was there, standing at the very end of the narrow way, and so I ran toward him, but before I could reach him, the dog woke me up...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732950405"
            ]
          },
          "732950405": {
            "id": "732950405",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Julien",
            "text": "Leaving the part with the dog aside for the moment, I believed this to be a good omen, and so I brought my sketching tools and set out.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732950406"
            ]
          },
          "732950406": {
            "id": "732950406",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Julien",
            "text": "In the end... I wound up running through the maze like a headless Cicin, and I was even attacked by hilichurls... Not only did I not escape, but I also lost the bag containing my drafts during the chase...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732950407"
            ]
          },
          "732950407": {
            "id": "732950407",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "I guess this is another day of losses for you.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732950408"
            ]
          },
          "732950408": {
            "id": "732950408",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Julien",
            "text": "But can you blame me? This place is even harder to navigate than the sewers in Fontaine! ...Wait, the people of Sumeru live in trees, right? Could this place really be...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732950409"
            ]
          },
          "732950409": {
            "id": "732950409",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Julien",
            "text": "What do the people of Sumeru even, um, excrete...!?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732950410"
            ]
          },
          "732950410": {
            "id": "732950410",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "This isn't what you're thinking about!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732950411"
            ]
          },
          "732950411": {
            "id": "732950411",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Julien",
            "text": "*sigh* My life has been but a series of failures. One ill-advised step after another.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732950412"
            ]
          },
          "732950412": {
            "id": "732950412",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Julien",
            "text": "Why did I leave my place of safety this morning? I saw a good omen in my dream, but it was just a dream, after all. Why did I take it for reality?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732950413"
            ]
          },
          "732950413": {
            "id": "732950413",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Julien",
            "text": "I should've been completely honest about the trouble I'm in... If I had asked you to lead the way, I wouldn't have ended up in this situation.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732950414"
            ]
          },
          "732950414": {
            "id": "732950414",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Julien",
            "text": "Oh, why did I leave Fontaine in the first place? My life there had not yet become untenable anyway... On the other hand, not a single good thing has occurred ever since I came here.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732950415"
            ]
          },
          "732950415": {
            "id": "732950415",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Don't give up just yet! We can still take you to see some awesome places. But for now, we'll help you look for the things you've lost!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732950416"
            ]
          },
          "732950416": {
            "id": "732950416",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Um, even though we're not sure if we can get them back in one piece...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732950417"
            ]
          },
          "732950417": {
            "id": "732950417",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Julien",
            "text": "Haha, they might have been taken and used by hilichurls as toilet paper, for all we know! Well... Whatever the case... they weren't very expensive things anyway...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732950418"
            ]
          },
          "732950418": {
            "id": "732950418",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Be honest, please.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732950419"
            ]
          },
          "732950419": {
            "id": "732950419",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Yeah. Even if they aren't worth much in terms of Mora, they're precious to you, aren't they? We'll help you find them!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732950420"
            ]
          },
          "732950420": {
            "id": "732950420",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Speaking of which, where's Pepper? Isn't it with you?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732950421"
            ]
          },
          "732950421": {
            "id": "732950421",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Julien",
            "text": "Hmph, that heartless creature ran off a long time ago... It's probably relaxing in some hiding spot of its own right now.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732950422"
            ]
          },
          "732950422": {
            "id": "732950422",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "That's kinda hard to believe...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732950423"
            ]
          },
          "732950423": {
            "id": "732950423",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Well, anyway, why don't you return to your camp first and treat your injuries? We'll come back and look for you once we find the lost items.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732950424"
            ]
          },
          "732950424": {
            "id": "732950424",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Julien",
            "text": "Thank you, my... friends. Ah, what have we to rely on in this life but friends?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
