    {
      "subId": "7329508",
      "subQuestName": "Go to the camp and talk to Julien",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "732950801"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "732950801": {
            "id": "732950801",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "As we thought, Pepper's already back!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732950802"
            ]
          },
          "732950802": {
            "id": "732950802",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hey, Julien! We found your sketches!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732950803"
            ]
          },
          "732950803": {
            "id": "732950803",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Julien",
            "text": "Ah, thank you so much, my friends... To think that you went through all that for such worthless items...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732950804"
            ]
          },
          "732950804": {
            "id": "732950804",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Don't say that! Aren't you a famous artist from Fontaine? Your sketches would sell for a pretty sum, wouldn't they?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732950805"
            ]
          },
          "732950805": {
            "id": "732950805",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Julien",
            "text": "Um, well, I suppose so... To be honest, I don't really think about things like that... True art should be priceless, right?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732950806"
            ]
          },
          "732950806": {
            "id": "732950806",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Whoa, no wonder you're a famous artist. Your words feel so full of... artistic flair! Speaking of which, Pepper was guarding your sketches when we found them.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732950807"
            ]
          },
          "732950807": {
            "id": "732950807",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Just like before.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732950808"
            ]
          },
          "732950808": {
            "id": "732950808",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "That's right! Paimon thinks that it still cares a lot about you.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732950809"
            ]
          },
          "732950809": {
            "id": "732950809",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Julien",
            "text": "You mean, that same dog who keeps leading me down strange paths no matter how long I've fed it, and leaves me to face the hilichurls on my own?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732950810"
            ]
          },
          "732950810": {
            "id": "732950810",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Well... I—It probably had some considerations of its own!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732950811"
            ]
          },
          "732950811": {
            "id": "732950811",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Even though you're saying all these things, you actually really like Pepper, right? You wouldn't have taken a photo of it using a special Kamera otherwise.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732950812"
            ]
          },
          "732950812": {
            "id": "732950812",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Julien",
            "text": "Photo? What photo?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732950813"
            ]
          },
          "732950813": {
            "id": "732950813",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "There's a picture of a dog clipped between your sketches, and it looks just like Pepper. The colors used were quite unique too. You must have used some sort of special Kamera to take that photo, right?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732950814"
            ]
          },
          "732950814": {
            "id": "732950814",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Julien",
            "text": "Um... Actually, I drew that.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732950815"
            ]
          },
          "732950815": {
            "id": "732950815",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Eh? S—Seriously? Guess you're pretty good, Mr. Renowned Artist. Not only did it look very lifelike, but your use of colors was also very... um, artistic!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732950816"
            ]
          },
          "732950816": {
            "id": "732950816",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Julien",
            "text": "...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732950817"
            ]
          },
          "732950817": {
            "id": "732950817",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "(Did Paimon say anything wrong?)",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732950820"
            ]
          },
          "732950820": {
            "id": "732950820",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Julien",
            "text": "I didn't want to draw like this... I just... wanted to become a first-rate artist. Do you also think it's an impossible endeavor?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732950821"
            ]
          },
          "732950821": {
            "id": "732950821",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Julien",
            "text": "*sigh* Sorry, I shouldn't have lied to you, my friends. Once you tell a lie, you have to keep on lying... I've had enough...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732950822"
            ]
          },
          "732950822": {
            "id": "732950822",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Julien",
            "text": "In truth, I'm just an amateur artist who can't \"correctly\" differentiate color the way other people do, but I didn't want to give up on my dream to become a true artist.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732950823"
            ]
          },
          "732950823": {
            "id": "732950823",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Julien",
            "text": "With the help of... a friend's powers, I am now able to draw anything exactly as it appears — but I still can't seem to tell colors apart.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732950824"
            ]
          },
          "732950824": {
            "id": "732950824",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Wait, you said that you can now draw anything exactly as it appears... Is that really something you can just... learn overnight?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732950825"
            ]
          },
          "732950825": {
            "id": "732950825",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Julien",
            "text": "Well, this friend of mine is quite a powerful person.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732950826"
            ]
          },
          "732950826": {
            "id": "732950826",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Really? That's kinda hard to believe.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732950827"
            ]
          },
          "732950827": {
            "id": "732950827",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Julien",
            "text": "Or perhaps I should say that I have lost my ability to draw things in a way other than exactly how it appears. I suppose this is what they call \"the price of power.\" I know it sounds a little outrageous, but...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732950828"
            ]
          },
          "732950828": {
            "id": "732950828",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Black Screen",
            "text": "Julien replicates an Adventurer's Experience for you.\\nYou study the replica and the original, and find no difference between them.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732950848"
            ]
          },
          "732950848": {
            "id": "732950848",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Black Screen",
            "text": "The only difference, perhaps, is that after you read it, the replica only leaves a strange, blank feeling in your mind...\\nIt feels like you did read it, and yet you didn't. Like time alone was wasted without any experience gained...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732950849"
            ]
          },
          "732950849": {
            "id": "732950849",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "It really doesn't look any different from the original...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732950829"
            ]
          },
          "732950829": {
            "id": "732950829",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Julien",
            "text": "Of course, I didn't become a famous artist of any sort, but I did become a real dab hand at counterfeiting.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732950830"
            ]
          },
          "732950830": {
            "id": "732950830",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "But isn't that illegal?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732950831"
            ]
          },
          "732950831": {
            "id": "732950831",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Julien",
            "text": "...Exactly, and so after serving my sentence, I was determined to do something legitimate. This time, I will become a proper artist for sure!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732950832"
            ]
          },
          "732950832": {
            "id": "732950832",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Julien",
            "text": "But this ability to draw things in such exactitude... If Caterpillar had not been the one to grant it to me, I would have named it a curse.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732950833"
            ]
          },
          "732950833": {
            "id": "732950833",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Julien",
            "text": "I'm like a broken Kamera that can only create pictures with mismatched colors...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732950834"
            ]
          },
          "732950834": {
            "id": "732950834",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Julien",
            "text": "I believed that if I made a pilgrimage along the path of the Oceanids, I would be able to find a cure... that would let me differentiate color just like other people can, and grant me creativity akin to that of an innocent child..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7329509",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "732950901"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "732950901": {
            "id": "732950901",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Julien",
            "text": "The path of pilgrimage. How did I lose track of it...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732950902"
            ]
          },
          "732950902": {
            "id": "732950902",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "...The path of pilgrimage?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732950903"
            ]
          },
          "732950903": {
            "id": "732950903",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Julien",
            "text": "Ah, it's nothing. It's just... just a figure of speech."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7329512",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "732951201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "732951201": {
            "id": "732951201",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Julien",
            "text": "Ah, my friends, the lost sketches...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732951202"
            ]
          },
          "732951202": {
            "id": "732951202",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "We haven't gotten them yet.",
            "nextDialogs": [
